 - 2026-06-04: RECORD the product-headline status HONESTLY (G4 hygiene): apply the Reading-Results discipline (summarize_artifact + a LIVE adversarial re-check) to BOTH candidate product positives -- exp3798 (code-repair G4 re-run, delta=0.0pp) AND exp2090 (CRANE +15pp, which flags CRITICAL on live re-check: substrate=None, 0.009s, NOT a real 50-problem run) -- and record that NEITHER supports a product headline; the FoVer methods headline (0.9131) is the sole defensible one (north-star sec-1). Emit a doc-update PROPOSAL for the operator to retire the demoted code-repair prose in the technical report. Aggregation only; edits NO operator-curated doc. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: product_headline_status_recorded_code_repair_false_crane_false_sole_defensible_fover_0.9131_stays_demoted_doc_proposal_emitted_operator_curated_doc_unedited; results/experiment_3812_product_headline_status_consolidation.json
